# Review Expectations
> Standard: Review workflow

## Intent
Forces review output to prioritize bugs, regressions, and missing coverage.

## Rule
- Reviews should lead with findings, not praise or long summaries.
- Prioritize correctness and risk before style or formatting.
- Mention residual uncertainty and testing gaps when no bug is found.

